{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51813","headline":"无事歌（长沙狱椽任福祖，[拥]〖推〗驺吏出行。有卖药道人行吟云动。福祖审思，岂非异人，急遣访求，已出城矣。） · 卖药道人","name":"无事歌（长沙狱椽任福祖，[拥]〖推〗驺吏出行。有卖药道人行吟云动。福祖审思，岂非异人，急遣访求，已出城矣。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无事歌，呵呵亦呵呵，哀哀亦呵呵。\n不似荷叶参军子，人人与个拜[顷]木，大作厅上假阎罗。\n（《清异录》三）（〖1〗据商务排印本《说郛》卷六一引《清异录》校补。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卖药道人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}